    "version": "1",
    "description": "We provide xyz structure files at the B3LYP-D3(BJ,abc)/def2-TZVP level of computation for the following dimers: - benzyl alcohol + methyl (S)-(-)-lactate: most stable homochiral (gauche(-) benzyl alchohol) / heterochiral (gauche(+) benzyl alcohol) inserted and most stable homochiral / heterochiral associated - benzyl alcohol + methyl glycolate: most stable inserted and associated - 4-chlorobenzyl alcohol + methyl (S)-(-)-lactate: most stable homochiral / heterochiral inserted and most stable homochiral / heterochiral associated - 4-chlorobenzyl alcohol + methyl glycolate: most stable inserted and associated",
